  "account.onboarding.openWalletSub": { en: "Get a dedicated account number — low-fee transfers & bill payments", pidgin: "Get your own account number — cheap transfer & bill payment", ha: "Sami lambar asusu ta kanka — tura kuɗi da biyan kuɗi da ƙaramin caji", ig: "Nweta nọmba akaụntụ nke gị — ezigaga ego na ịkwụ ụgwọ n'ọnụ ala", yo: "Gba nọ́mbà àkáǹtì tìrẹ — ìfiránṣẹ́ owó àti sísan owó iná pẹ̀lú owó kékeré" },
